# CGWA-Style NOC Application Form - Implementation Plan

## Goal

Rebuild the NOC application form to precisely match CGWA BhuNeer system structure, including all 8 sections with proper field organization, validations, progress tracking, and styling as per government portal standards.

## CGWA BhuNeer Application Structure (From Analysis)

### Form Sections (8 Total)
1. **Basic Details** - Application type, project info, MSME status
2. **Location Details** - Coordinates, land area, wetland info
3. **Drinking & Domestic Use** - Worker/resident count, daily requirements
4. **Water Requirement Breakup** - Activity-wise water usage, STP/ETP details
5. **Ground Water Structure** - Existing and proposed bore wells/tube wells
6. **Attachments** - Document uploads (LOA, land ownership, DPR, etc.)
7. **GW Charges** - Auto-calculated fees based on usage and area category
8. **Application Summary & Payment** - Review and payment gateway integration

