## Styling & UX Improvements

### Progress Stepper

#### [MODIFY] [ProgressSteps.jsx](file:///c:/Users/DELL/Desktop/SGWA/src/modules/noc/components/ProgressSteps.jsx)

**Current:** Vertical or basic horizontal stepper
**CGWA Style:** Horizontal progress bar with numbered circles

```css
.cgwa-progress-stepper {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 30px 0;
  position: relative;
}

.cgwa-step {
  flex: 1;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
}

.cgwa-step-number {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #e0e0e0;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.cgwa-step.active .cgwa-step-number {
  background: #1e3a8a;
  color: white;
}

.cgwa-step.completed .cgwa-step-number {
  background: #28a745;
  color: white;
}
```

### Form Layout

**Grid System:** 2-column for most fields, 3-column for State/District/Block

```css
.noc-form-row.two-col {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
}

.noc-form-row.three-col {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
}
```

### Field Styling

```css
.noc-form-control {
  padding: 10px 15px;
  border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 14px;
  background: #f8fafc;
}

.noc-form-control:focus {
  border-color: #1e3a8a;
  background: white;
  outline: none;
}

.noc-form-label.required::after {
  content: ' *';
  color: #dc2626;
}
```

