## Validation Rules

### Step-by-Step Validation

**Step 1:** All mandatory application type fields
**Step 2:** Valid coordinates, PIN code format  
**Step 3:** Numbers > 0 for worker/resident counts
**Step 4:** Water breakup must balance (total = sum of sources)
**Step 5:** At least one structure must be added
**Step 6:** All mandatory documents uploaded (PDF < 5MB)
**Step 7:** Fees calculated and displayed
**Step 8:** Declaration accepted

### Real-time Validation

```javascript
// Coordinate validation
const validateLatitude = (lat) => {
  const num = parseFloat(lat);
  return num >= -90 && num <= 90;
};

const validateLongitude = (long) => {
  const num = parseFloat(long);
  return num >= -180 && num <= 180;
};

// PIN code validation
const validatePIN = (pin) => /^\d{6}$/.test(pin);
```

